{"nodes": [{"id": "build_css_p2_docs_javascript_pages_phase_5_built_in_library_array_iteration_methods_callbacks_holes_and_async_callback_arity", "label": "Iteration callback arity", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/javascript/pages/phase-5-built-in-library/array-iteration-methods/callbacks-holes-and-async.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Callbacks receive (element, index, array). Most methods take thisArg; reduce and sort do not."}, {"id": "build_css_p2_docs_javascript_pages_phase_5_built_in_library_array_iteration_methods_callbacks_holes_and_async_map_parseint", "label": "map(parseInt) radix trap", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/javascript/pages/phase-5-built-in-library/array-iteration-methods/callbacks-holes-and-async.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "map passes index as parseInt radix, so [\"1\",\"2\",\"3\"].map(parseInt) is [1, NaN, NaN]."}, {"id": "build_css_p2_docs_javascript_pages_phase_5_built_in_library_array_iteration_methods_callbacks_holes_and_async_foreach_async_trap", "label": "forEach async trap", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/javascript/pages/phase-5-built-in-library/array-iteration-methods/callbacks-holes-and-async.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "forEach does not wait for promises. async callbacks are discarded; filter(async) keeps everything because promises are truthy."}, {"id": "build_css_p2_docs_javascript_pages_phase_5_built_in_library_array_iteration_methods_callbacks_holes_and_async_find_visits_holes", "label": "find visits holes", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/javascript/pages/phase-5-built-in-library/array-iteration-methods/callbacks-holes-and-async.html", "source_l